# trailer_mgmt.func

> Module: trailer_mgmt (Dorse Yönetimi) | Category: FLEET

## Purpose
Trailer (semi-trailer/dorse) fleet management. Track trailers separately from trucks with their own plates, types, and linked tractor units. Added in v2.34.

## Problems It Solves
- Turkish logistics companies operate trailers independently from trucks
- Trailers have separate inspection cycles and plates
- Need to track which trailer is attached to which truck (bağlı çekici)
- Separate from truck maintenance scheduling

## Technical Database Structure
**Table:** `trailers`
| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | SERIAL PK | Unique identifier |
| tenant_id | INTEGER FK | Tenant isolation |
| plaka | VARCHAR(20) | Trailer plate |
| marka | VARCHAR(100) | Brand |
| tip | trailer_tip_enum | Type of trailer |
| yil | INTEGER | Year |
| bagli_cekici_id | INTEGER FK | Linked truck (nullable) |
| aktif | BOOLEAN | Active status |
| created_at, updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | Timestamps |

**Enum:** `trailer_tip_enum` — TENTELI, KONTEYNER, LOWBED, FRIGO, SARNIC, ACKASA, DAMPER

## User Interface
**TrailersPage.tsx** — `/dashboard/trailers`
- DataGrid table: Plaka, Marka, Tip, Yıl, Bağlı Çekici
- Add/Edit modal with truck selector dropdown
- Delete with confirmation
- Export, bulk operations via DataGrid

## API Endpoints
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|--------|------|:---:|-------------|
| GET | `/api/tenant/trailers/` | Tenant JWT | List trailers |
| POST | `/api/tenant/trailers/` | Tenant JWT | Add trailer |
| PUT | `/api/tenant/trailers/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Edit trailer |
| DELETE | `/api/tenant/trailers/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Remove trailer |

